WEBVTT

00:10:58.755 --> 00:11:00.215
and in the future,

00:11:00.239 --> 00:11:02.825
when combined with the latest innovations.

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:07.318
After all, we're all guests in this world,

00:11:07.342 --> 00:11:11.071
so let's do right
by the earth and each other

00:11:11.095 --> 00:11:14.182
just like the ancient
Mongolian nomads did.

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:15.706
Thank you.